{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "df0b0dc60c3ed59d1825e9b0e816b471b3352ee92167721af34a0cad08c8c6c9", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画の撮影日。千早と猫の仲のいい\n姿を撮る予定だが、千早は難しい顔をしている……）", "zh": "（Cosplay写真企划的拍摄日。原本计划拍摄千早和猫咪亲密相处的样子，可千早却露出了为难的表情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "905003c25c63c36d2228346dcd558ab4c6d19bd1edfdc380455ee4da3e2284f7", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}。\n撮影プランをみていて、ひとつ気になることが。", "zh": "抱歉，{$P$}。\n我看了拍摄计划，有一件事让我有些在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a56aadea00362763f56c46b7149ccbf146b33e43f3bd01234a62a432621f6d9e", "ja": "何かわからないことでもあったか？", "zh": "是遇到什么不明白的地方了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "d25133d54a9287a0df754993ecf96c1ae7b3edd606dd011f4e97211e58b7b4ea", "ja": "はい。この『猫吸い』という言葉なんですけど。\nこれは、何かの例えでしょうか？", "zh": "是的。我是想问“猫吸”这个词。\n这是在比喻什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1004_p", "source_sha256": "82326cf1cdcd400e194f3209330c46a7a58c480aa53a3cadc114f42993667e06", "ja": "いや、そのままの意味だよ。猫を吸うんだ。", "zh": "不，就是字面意思。就是吸猫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "37484833086c360bc1f7695e4ed87542aaed720b3b0e44374ad5c5653c5e495e", "ja": "えっ？　猫を……吸う……？\n動物を、吸う……。……私にできるかしら……。", "zh": "咦？吸猫……？\n吸……动物……我做得到吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c641540b8e596fdf66aaeafda333c6c3483e4a9dc6cebc9fa3b346f404a2c075", "ja": "ごめん、ちゃんと説明するよ。猫の体に顔を押し当てて\n香りを堪能する人が、一定数いるみたいでね。", "zh": "抱歉，我好好解释一下。听说有些人会把脸贴在猫身上，尽情享受它的香气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "595d52a2e03bff0bf2d4d3072d7a340bd8eca715f03f3a740d988a3468153c12", "ja": "なるほど。香りを吸い込むという意味なんですね。\nやはり、大きすぎると思ったんです。", "zh": "原来如此。是指吸入香气啊。\n我就觉得，还是太大了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "428351c8b48b5ed7be6b1ab90874f9c64114c6349478ed81d72b3573af770bb5", "ja": "（千早が何を考えていたのか気になるけど、\n今はそっとしておこう……）", "zh": "（虽然有点在意千早刚才在想什么，但现在还是先别打扰她吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "4491d9e4c34e3fb704d7bf3aa19a8c17b4d221d9744eed99fae11507d9b51a68", "ja": "ですが、写真を見た人は喜んでくれるでしょうか？\n顔も半分隠れますし、はたしてどう見えるのか……。", "zh": "不过，看到照片的人会开心吗？脸也遮住了一半，究竟看起来会是什么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1010_p", "source_sha256": "057cb9a969d739a6e7884f3cd4a37f198165b75c60cb72ddd111743de637d063", "ja": "なるほど。ダメかなあ……。\n仲良しアピールには、よさそうだと思ったんだけどな。", "zh": "原来如此。不行吗……。\n我还以为用来展示我们关系好，应该挺合适的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "7929ed94af31465856a5ecc05497e4f782f8c864929a30fe7fefa68ba3409877", "ja": "仲良しアピール……。", "zh": "表现亲密……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1012_p", "source_sha256": "021fb5abd6c8139d8e2c8edc995fd5fdf77c05fff00737826dcb97a8c954a07d", "ja": "ああ。相手は初対面の猫だから、すんなり触らせて\nくれるとも限らないし。今回は他の方法で……。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟对方是第一次见面的猫，也不一定会乖乖让我们摸。这次就用其他方法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "5daa11712158bf8ac4bc127dcba9cea454eafd9d3f9edbd79d80dd42a3706b1e", "ja": "待ってください、{$P$}。\n私、挑戦してみます。猫吸いに。", "zh": "请等一下，{$P$}。\n我想挑战一下。去吸猫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1014_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "3950728f37aa06ac6afca65f8b17e1d7ebb2413342b9c7dea0427a29842a9fe3", "ja": "考えたんですが、無難な方法ではダメだと思います。\n撮影時の雰囲気は、写真を見ればわかりますから。", "zh": "我想过了，但我觉得采用稳妥的方法是不行的。\n拍摄时的氛围，看照片就能明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "221284100007c6ea31f0cf42de6a565942470420181fa00483b69af2404988c9", "ja": "恐らく猫吸いは、相手に気を許してくれていると\nいう証……。それなら試さない手はありません。", "zh": "吸猫大概就是它已经对自己放下戒心的\n证明……既然如此，就没有不试一试的道理了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e43e0953a72ee0a155f8aa0a43a0675786f9730b7e575da335a920b3362a1430", "ja": "そうか。千早が決めたなら、\n俺は成功するようにサポートするだけだ！", "zh": "这样啊。既然千早已经决定了，我只要支持你成功就行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "ad3f852d9d9d1a565cbc687eb77cb944f60a4ea72f6905ef4f7c715d2472dc26", "ja": "はい。お願いします、{$P$}。\n私、吸います。必ず猫と仲良くなってみせます！", "zh": "好的。拜托你了，{$P$}。\n我会吸的。一定要和猫咪成为好朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0593_1019_p", "source_sha256": "98cadaf6a7c936bc1ab3e30326c076bb284915be9ebefcb9e43dfa1686ecc9f3", "ja": "（結局……千早の猫吸いは成功しなかった。だが、\n猫と仲良くしようと頑張る千早のいい写真が撮れた）", "zh": "（结果……千早没能成功“吸猫”。不过，还是拍到了千早努力和猫咪亲近的好照片）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
